           "<p>Backup heat deserves just as much thought. When a cold snap settles in for a week, you want a second heat source ready to go. We either keep your propane or oil furnace in a hybrid setup, or install an electric air handler with built-in heat strips, and set the controls so the switch happens on its own.</p>"
